  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "transparent": true,
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "## Wallet Pool\nWho we follow. Style = median token age at the wallet's entry on its winners: SNIPER (launch, unfollowable) · MM (market-maker, unfollowable) · SELECTOR (hours-old, the copyable edge). Re-tier 2026-09-25 pruned 174 snipers/MMs from active."
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "table",
   "title": "Pool by tier × wallet style",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "postgres",
    "uid": "fleet-postgres"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "postgres",
      "uid": "fleet-postgres"
     },
     "format": "table",
     "rawQuery": true,
     "editorMode": "code",
     "rawSql": "SELECT wp.tier, count(*) AS wallets, count(*) FILTER (WHERE ws.cls = 'SELECTOR') AS \"SELECTOR\", count(*) FILTER (WHERE ws.cls = 'SNIPER') AS \"SNIPER\", count(*) FILTER (WHERE ws.cls = 'MM_HFT') AS \"MM_HFT\", count(*) FILTER (WHERE ws.cls = 'MM_ESTABLISHED') AS \"MM_ESTABLISHED\", count(*) FILTER (WHERE ws.cls = 'OTHER') AS \"OTHER\",\n  count(*) FILTER (WHERE ws.cls IS NULL) AS unclassified,\n  count(*) FILTER (WHERE wp.swing) AS swing_roster, count(*) FILTER (WHERE wp.conviction) AS conviction_roster,\n  count(*) FILTER (WHERE wp.pinned) AS pinned\nFROM wallet_pool wp LEFT JOIN wallet_style ws ON ws.address = wp.address\nGROUP BY wp.tier ORDER BY CASE wp.tier WHEN 'active' THEN 1 WHEN 'teamfollow' THEN 2 WHEN 'watch' THEN 3 ELSE 4 END"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "align": "auto",
      "filterable": false,
      "minWidth": 50
     }
    },
